{"unit_id":"Zxznb666__dsh-qoder-cn-subagent#feature-1","repo":"Zxznb666/dsh-qoder-cn-subagent","commit":"502635381b831a183175cf10fc97452fce452769","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Qoder CN Subagent 的功能「委派单次任务」：通过 qoder_subagent 将文本提示送入 Qoder CN agent 循环，并把最终答复收回父会话。工具由 bundle 配置接入，执行支持取消。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-14","lib/index.js:110-150","lib/qoder-cn.js:213-278"]}
{"unit_id":"Zxznb666__dsh-qoder-cn-subagent#feature-2","repo":"Zxznb666/dsh-qoder-cn-subagent","commit":"502635381b831a183175cf10fc97452fce452769","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Qoder CN Subagent 的功能「原生认证或令牌」：可复用 Qoder CN CLI 登录，也可通过配置值或环境变量提供个人访问令牌；auto 模式在令牌可用时选令牌，否则使用 CLI 认证。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:46-53","lib/index.js:162-173","lib/qoder-cn.js:132-145"]}
{"unit_id":"Zxznb666__dsh-qoder-cn-subagent#feature-3","repo":"Zxznb666/dsh-qoder-cn-subagent","commit":"502635381b831a183175cf10fc97452fce452769","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Qoder CN Subagent 的功能「转交 MCP 设置」：启用后读取 Qoder CN 的 settings.json，将其中未禁用的 MCP 服务器传给子会话；关闭此选项或设置文件不可用时不添加服务器选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:125-136","lib/qoder-cn.js:88-98","lib/qoder-cn.js:157-165"]}
{"unit_id":"Zxznb666__dsh-qoder-cn-subagent#feature-4","repo":"Zxznb666/dsh-qoder-cn-subagent","commit":"502635381b831a183175cf10fc97452fce452769","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Qoder CN Subagent 的功能「整理提示与结果」：把文本提示块合并成文本，非文本附件以省略标记呈现；完成后优先返回结果消息中的最终答复，并将错误、取消和完成状态转换为 DSH 结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/qoder-cn.js:176-184","lib/qoder-cn.js:213-278"]}
